  "text": "**Alex:** So, did you hear about the new caf\u00e9 opening downtown?\n\n**Jamie:** No, I haven\u2019t. Is it any good?\n\n**Alex:** Honestly, I\u2019m not sure. The owner\u2019s been really vague about what they\u2019re serving.\n\n**Jamie:** Huh. I guess it\u2019s better than the old place, though. That used to be the worst.\n\n**Alex:** Totally. I mean, I can\u2019t even remember the last time I had a decent coffee there.\n\n**Jamie:** Right? I think they had a pumpkin spice latte once. It was... okay.\n\n**Alex:** Yeah, and I thought it was a masterpiece. I told my friends it was the best thing since sliced bread.\n\n**Jamie:** You\u2019re such a drama queen sometimes. But hey, maybe the new place has better coffee.\n\n**Alex:** Maybe. But I\u2019d rather just go to the bodega across the street. They have better pastries.\n\n**Jamie:** Fair enough. But I\u2019d still like to check out the new place. I\u2019m curious what they\u2019re serving.\n\n**Alex:** Yeah, maybe I\u2019ll go with you. I could use a break from the same old stuff.\n\n**Jamie:** Deal. Let me know when you\u2019re free.\n\n**Alex:** Will do. I\u2019ll text you once I get a better idea of what they\u2019re doing.\n\n**Jamie:** Sounds good. I can\u2019t wait to see what you think.\n\n**Alex:** Me neither. It\u2019s always fun to try something new.",
